{"id":"lm51actxtnbyesyag1kmtceum","title":"什么是键？","originalTitle":"杂说“键”（1）什么是键？","summary":"键字的本义是固定物体的横杠，引申为决定性因素。化学中的键是指原子间的相互作用，如离子键、共价键等，用于形成分子或晶体。各种键都具有固定的意义，无论是物理设备中的键还是化学中的键。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=612874&do=blog&id=1560636"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T01:11:29.802Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T01:11:29.802Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表"],"score":24,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}